// Difficulty presets (sim::difficulty): what a new game offers under "World". Easiest first.
// Every number is a multiplier on the game's own (1 = as shipped) unless it says otherwise;
// anything left out is 1 (or the game's own).
//
//   id, name, about
//   zombies            how many (the population)
//   fast_zombies       Some(share 0..1) of them that are fast; None: population.ron's
//   zombie_senses      how alert they are: each one's sight and hearing (and chance to notice)
//   zombie_sight       how far they see, by day and by night
//   zombie_hearing     how far every sound carries to them
//   zombie_memory      how long they keep after someone they lost, look round a noise, batter a door
//   zombie_speed       how fast they walk and run
//   zombie_toughness   their hit points
//   zombie_accuracy    how often their strikes land
//   zombie_damage      how much a wound from one takes
//   respawn            Some(true/false): do far regions fill up again; None: population.ron's
//   loot, rare_loot    how much containers hold; how often the rare things turn up
//   xp                 how fast skills grow
//   needs              how fast hunger, thirst and tiredness come
//   infection          Off | Survivable | Deadly
//   day_minutes        Some(real minutes a game day lasts); None: the game's own (60)
//   values             any single tuning number by its path (sim::tune), set outright after the
//                      multipliers, e.g. values: {"zombie.memory_secs": "30", "combat.player_hp": "150"}
//   tuning             a whole tuning section, set outright, e.g.
//                        tuning: (zombie: Some((memory_secs: 30)), combat: Some((player_hp: 150)))
//
// The new-game screen lets the player change zombies, loot, xp, respawn, infection, the day's
// length and the hour they wake on top of a preset, and on its Sandbox page any number at all
// (sandbox.ron names the likeliest). A server takes a preset with --difficulty ID. Names and
// numbers are ours.
[
    (id: "easy_street", name: "Easy street",
        about: "Fewer of the dead, duller ones, and full cupboards. For learning the town.",
        zombies: 0.6, zombie_senses: 0.8, zombie_sight: 0.85, zombie_memory: 0.7,
        zombie_toughness: 0.85, zombie_accuracy: 0.8, zombie_damage: 0.85,
        loot: 1.5, rare_loot: 1.5, xp: 1.5, needs: 0.8, infection: Survivable),
    (id: "survivor", name: "Survivor",
        about: "The game as it is meant to be played."),
    (id: "hard_times", name: "Hard times",
        about: "More of them, sharper, and the houses have been picked over.",
        zombies: 1.5, fast_zombies: Some(0.25), zombie_senses: 1.15, zombie_hearing: 1.15,
        zombie_memory: 1.3, zombie_accuracy: 1.1,
        loot: 0.7, rare_loot: 0.7, needs: 1.15, respawn: Some(true)),
    (id: "last_one_left", name: "Last one left",
        about: "The town is full, they miss nothing, and there is very little left to find.",
        zombies: 2.2, fast_zombies: Some(0.4), zombie_senses: 1.3, zombie_sight: 1.15, zombie_hearing: 1.3,
        zombie_memory: 1.6, zombie_toughness: 1.15, zombie_accuracy: 1.2, zombie_damage: 1.2,
        loot: 0.45, rare_loot: 0.5, xp: 0.8, needs: 1.3, respawn: Some(true)),
]
